      "title": "Edison International Q3 Earnings Outpace Estimates, Revenues Miss",
      "summary": "Edison International (EIX) reported Q3 2026 core EPS of $1.92, beating estimates by 4.9%, but revenues of $4.89 billion missed by 11.7%. Southern California Edison's earnings declined 17.9% year-over-year due to absence of prior-year GRC benefits. EIX reaffirmed 2026 guidance of $5.90-$6.20 EPS and maintained 5-7% annual earnings growth target through 2030.",
