      "title": "EIX Q3 Earnings Call Highlights Urgency of Wildfire Reform",
      "summary": "Edison International (EIX) reaffirmed its 2026 EPS guidance of $5.90-$6.20 and 5%-7% annual core earnings growth through 2030, while emphasizing the urgent need for California wildfire liability reform. The company faces rising infrastructure financing costs potentially reaching $300 million due to elevated credit spreads, and is managing Eaton Fire liabilities with over $1.1 billion in settlement offers extended. EIX plans $38B-$41B in capital spending through 2030 while advancing grid hardening efforts.",
